{ solution_string.init - a DSEE derived object of the ISC generator's
  input (cc.a88k only): the names of the solution kinds (the SOLUTION$
  enumeration, 25 entries of 32 characters, blank-filled: none ..
  k_max).  Included by lir.pas after solution_kind.init, in the section
  lir_readonly_tables (+0x340 .. +0x65F).

  The declaration only (lir.pas's `var (lir_readonly_tables)').  No
  Apollo copy survives; reconstructed from the section's bytes
  (translator PA6).

  Not known from the original: the variable's name. }

  solution_string: array [0..24] of packed array [1..32] of char := [
    'none                            ',  { 0 }
    'case_jump_base                  ',  { 1 }
    'fp_reg_pair_high                ',  { 2 }
    'fp_reg_pair_low                 ',  { 3 }
